  "final_message": "Implemented the kanban board.\n\n**Backend** (`backend/app.py`): SQLite persistence under `./data`, token auth (`register`/`login`, Bearer tokens), task CRUD with status/priority filters, ordered listing, per-status counts, and gap-free positions on create/move/delete. Serves the frontend build and `GET /api/health`.\n\n**Frontend** (`frontend/src`): React + TypeScript + Tailwind v4, three columns with counts, priority badges/filter, auth forms, create/edit/delete dialogs with API validation messages, and drag-and-drop between/within columns that patches status and position.\n\nVerified with API smoke tests (auth, CRUD, reorder, move, delete gap closure, persistence across restart) and `tsc --noEmit` plus `npm run build`. Dependencies were pinned and lock files updated.",
  "final_message_truncated": false,
